cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this protocol, please cite it as below."
title: "DataDiet-EHR: a reproducible activation-based training-subset selection protocol for clinical language models"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible pipeline that scores every training example by its
  target-domain neuron activation, keeps a stratified, deduplicated subset,
  and evaluates whether the subset matches full-data performance under a
  pre-registered equivalence margin. Reports a null band of 19 random
  30% subsets, with per-seed predictions, selection logs and a
  claim-evidence matrix.
type: software
